      "subtask_answer": "From sub-problems 3 and 4:  \n\n- \\(|\\pi - 3.14| \\approx 0.001592653589793...\\)  \n- \\(|\\pi - \\frac{22}{7}| \\approx 0.000648511447...\\)  \n\nAdding them:  \n\n\\[\n0.001592653589793... + 0.000648511447... \\approx 0.002241165036793...\n\\]\n\nThe exact value of \\(|\\pi - 3.14| + |\\pi - \\frac{22}{7}|\\) is  \n\n\\[\n\\left(\\pi - 3.14\\right) + \\left(\\frac{22}{7} - \\pi\\right) = \\frac{22}{7} - 3.14\n\\]\n\nNow, \\(3.14 = \\frac{314}{100} = \\frac{157}{50}\\).  \n\n\\[\n\\frac{22}{7} - \\frac{157}{50} = \\frac{1100 - 1099}{350} = \\frac{1}{350}\n\\]\n\n**Answer:** \\(\\frac{1}{350}\\)",
